# Stores ML artifacts produced by sentiment.ml.* training scripts.
# Tracked by .gitkeep so the directory survives a clean checkout.
# Files generated here (corpus.parquet, sentiment_clf.joblib,
# sentiment_bert/, prof_embeddings.npz, *_metrics.json) are NOT
# committed - they are reproducible from the scripts in
# backend/sentiment/ml/ and the README's quickstart.
